C1 body sources
ai-delivery: Both --body and --body-file were supplied.
Fix: Pass only one of --body or --body-file.

C2 reconciliation file
ai-delivery: The reconciliation input is not a regular file of at most 16 MiB.
Fix: Pass a regular UTF-8 JSON file no larger than 16 MiB.

C2 reconciliation size
ai-delivery: The reconciliation input is not a regular file of at most 16 MiB.
Fix: Pass a regular UTF-8 JSON file no larger than 16 MiB.

C3 reconciliation modes
ai-delivery: Project reconciliation cannot use --dry-run and --apply together.
Fix: Pass only --dry-run or --apply.

C4 PR state
ai-delivery: The PR state is invalid.
Fix: Set --state to open, closed or all.

C5 review action
ai-delivery: The review action is invalid.
Fix: Use review submit or review doctor.

C6 reviewer binding
ai-delivery: The selected reviewer profile is not bound to a reviewer App.
Fix: Select a configured reviewer profile with an explicit App and provider binding.

C7 doctor inputs
ai-delivery: Review doctor received submission options.
Fix: Remove --pr, --head and --verdict when using review doctor.

C8 submit inputs
ai-delivery: Review submission is missing required options.
Fix: Pass --pr, --head and --verdict to review submit.

C9 verdict size
ai-delivery: The review verdict file exceeds 64 KiB.
Fix: Pass a verdict JSON file no larger than 64 KiB.

C10 verdict encoding
ai-delivery: The review verdict file is not valid UTF-8.
Fix: Pass a verdict JSON file encoded as UTF-8.
